   "2024: a 0.10 distribution each month, record date the 20th, paid the 28th. 1,000 units Jan to Jul: 100.00 each; July's 100.00 reinvested in 10 units, settled 07-29 after July's record date; 1,010 units Aug to Dec: 101.00 each. Cash on the year's record dates: 7 x 100 + 5 x 101 = 1,205.00.",
   "2024 slip: box 42 602.50, income 702.50, no foreign tax. No per-unit figures: box 42 placed by cash, 602.50 x 100/1,205 = 50.00 and x 101/1,205 = 50.50; the last, December, takes the rest: 602.50 - (7 x 50.00 + 4 x 50.50) = 50.50.",
