   "Sold 510 on Monday 2025-06-23, after June's record date: T+1, settled 06-24. Cost of the 510 = 9,303.89 x 510/1,010 = 4,698.0039 -> 4,698.00; 4,605.89 left on 500. Received 4,988.01 with a 9.99 commission: proceeds 4,998.00, outlays 9.99, gain 4,998.00 - 4,698.00 - 9.99 = 290.01.",
